        "created_at": "2025-03-06T03:58:04.617Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello Sir/Madam,</p>\n<p>I am writing to apologize for the late submission of my BPT3 of System Commands. Unfortunately, I encountered some issues with my laptop that delayed my ability to submit the work on time.</p>\n<p>However, I submitted the answers after the deadline (in under 2 days), and I was able to successfully pass 3 out of the 4 questions. I kindly request that you consider my scores for the OPPE 1 qualification.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your understanding, and I appreciate your consideration.</p>",
